		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=12943#p12943"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour A tous<br />J’ai des problèmes avec la commande merge<br />Dans l’application Query&#160; j’exécute les commandes de l’exemple du site <a href="https://wiki.postgresql.org/wiki/MergeTestExamples" rel="nofollow">https://wiki.postgresql.org/wiki/MergeTestExamples</a><br />Lorsque j’exécute la commande <br />MERGE INTO Stock USING Buy ON Stock.item_id = Buy.item_id<br /> WHEN MATCHED THEN UPDATE SET balance = balance + Buy.volume<br /> WHEN NOT MATCHED THEN INSERT VALUES (Buy.item_id, Buy.volume);</p><p>J’ai l’erreur <br />ERROR:&#160; syntax error at or near &quot;MERGE&quot;<br />LINE 2: MERGE INTO Stock USING Buy ON Stock.item_id = Buy.item_id<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; ^<br />********** Error **********</p><p>ERROR: syntax error at or near &quot;MERGE&quot;<br />SQL state: 42601<br />Character: 2<br />C’est&#160; quoi le problème svp.</p><p>Merci</p>]]></content>
